{"id":55,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"知性自律礼儀で未来を切り拓く教育","feature_description":"京都精華学園中学校・高等学校は、120年の伝統を土台に、変化する社会で必要な力を考え続ける学校です。教育方針に「知性・自律・礼儀」を掲げ、知識だけでなく判断力、自分を律する力、他者を思いやる心を重視します。建学の精神に基づく教育を更新しながら、未知の未来へ向かう生徒を育てています。公式サイトの紹介内容をもとに、教育方針や学校生活を整理してまとめています。","clubs":[{"id":1145,"name":"バスケットボール部（男・女）","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://k-seika.ed.jp/feature/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":1146,"name":"バドミントン部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://k-seika.ed.jp/feature/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":1147,"name":"サッカー部（男・女）","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://k-seika.ed.jp/feature/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":1148,"name":"陸上部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://k-seika.ed.jp/feature/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":1149,"name":"空手道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://k-seika.ed.jp/feature/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":1150,"name":"男子硬式野球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://k-seika.ed.jp/feature/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":1151,"name":"ソフトテニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://k-seika.ed.jp/feature/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":1152,"name":"剣道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://k-seika.ed.jp/feature/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":1153,"name":"なぎなた部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://k-seika.ed.jp/feature/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":1154,"name":"卓球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://k-seika.ed.jp/feature/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":1155,"name":"弓道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://k-seika.ed.jp/feature/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":1156,"name":"吹奏楽部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://k-seika.ed.jp/feature/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":1157,"name":"演劇部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://k-seika.ed.jp/feature/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":1158,"name":"美術部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://k-seika.ed.jp/feature/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":1159,"name":"家庭科部","category":"